    },
    {
      "text": "Combine pumpkin, evaporated milk, eggs, brown sugar, and white sugar together in a large bowl. Stir in cinnamon, ginger, salt, and cloves. Pour into the prepared pan. Sprinkle dry cake mix evenly over mixture. Sprinkle pecans evenly on top. Drizzle with butter.",
